        {
          "text": "O Nkosi Jehova, usuqalile ukubonisa inceku yakho ubukhulu bakho nesandla sakho esinamandla; ngokuba yimuphi uNkulunkulu ezulwini noma emhlabeni ongenza ngokwemisebenzi yakho nangamandla akho na?",
