        {
          "text": "Khuphukela esiqongweni sasePisiga, uphakamisele amehlo akho ngasentshonalanga, nasenyakatho, naseningizimu, nasempumalanga, ukubone ngamehlo akho, ngokuba awuyikuliwela leli Jordani.",
